##### Macro Static Neural Network: All-Together Specification #####
##### Forecast equation: xr_t = g(x_t, m_t) #####
##### Input: current forward rates + transformed FRED-MD macro variables #####
##### Two settings:
##### (1) single_no_val: single model, no validation
##### (2) avg_val: validation-based model averaging


